## Enterprise Safety Configuration

### Organization-Level Safety Policies

```json
{
  "enterprise": {
    "safety": {
      // Strict safety mode for regulated industries
      "mode": "strict",
      
      // Additional escalation for sensitive operations
      "escalationRequired": [
        "delete",
        "shell:delete",
        "shell:rm -rf",
        "sql:drop",
        "sql:truncate",
        "sql:delete",
        "sql:alter",
        "shell:sudo",
        "shell:chmod",
        "shell:chown",
        "shell:curl",
        "shell:wget",
        "shell:pip install",
        "shell:npm install -g"
